  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/resource/concept-catalog/#main-content)\n\n# AVI-SPLConceptCatalog\n\n![AVI-SPL Concept Catalog - Office image](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/AVI-SPL-Concept-Catalog-Office-image-1850.png)\n\n## Bold Ideas to Transform Employee and Customer Experiences\n\nWorkplace expectations keep rising. Employees want more seamless, intuitive experiences that work anywhere. This edition of the AVI-SPL Concept Catalog explores that and how personalized, future-ready solutions and expert services can help meet those demands.\n\nInside the catalog:\n\n- Technology strategies for building a future-ready workplace\n- Ways to activate the spaces between meetings with experience technology\n- How AI will reshape collaboration, communication, and engagement\n- Case studies from Carrollton Bank and National Bank of Canada\n- Greener tech choices that drive sustainable progress\n- How to protect enterprise control systems and stay ahead\n- Tech partner solutions that scale with your business\n\n### View the digital magazine\n\nClick the center of the concept catalog image to view in full-screen mode within your browser.\n\n[Download the Concept Catalog](https://pages.avispl.com/hubfs/2025/2025%20pdf%20assets/2025%20Concept%20Catalog/AVI-SPL%202025%20Winter%20Concept%20Catalog.pdf)\n\nFlipsnack player",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--player-width: 1920px; --player-height: 480px;\">\n\n<body class=\"wp-singular resource-template-default single single-resource postid-3537 wp-custom-logo wp-theme-avi-spl resource-id-3537\" style=\"\">\n<!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<!-- End Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->\n\n<div class=\"skip-link\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n    \t<a class=\"skip-link__btn\" href=\"https://avispl.com/resource/concept-catalog/#main-content\" aria-label=\"Skip to main content\">Skip to main content</a>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"single-resource__head\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"single__wrap\">\n\t\t\t<h1 data-splitting=\"words\" class=\"words splitting\" style=\"--word-total: 3; opacity: 1;\"><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"AVI-SPL\" style=\"--word-index: 0; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 41.8824% 0%, 41.8824% 41.8824%, 0% 41.8824%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">AVI-SPL</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Concept\" style=\"--word-index: 1; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 29.3559% 0%, 29.3559% 29.3559%, 0% 29.3559%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Concept</span></span><span class=\"whitespace\"> </span><span class=\"word\" data-word=\"Catalog\" style=\"--word-index: 2; clip-path: polygon(0% 0%, 14.7571% 0%, 14.7571% 14.7571%, 0% 14.7571%);\"><span style=\"translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px);\">Catalog</span></span></h1>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"single-resource__head__featured\"><img width=\"1850\" height=\"1164\" src=\"https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/AVI-SPL-Concept-Catalog-Office-image-1850.png\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"AVI-SPL Concept Catalog - Office image\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></div>\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"main\" class=\"single-resource__main\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"single__wrap body-content\">\n\t\t\t\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-bold-ideas-to-transform-employee-and-customer-experiences\"><br>Bold Ideas to Transform Employee and Customer Experiences</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Workplace expectations keep rising. Employees want more seamless, intuitive experiences that work anywhere. This edition of the AVI-SPL Concept Catalog explores that and how personalized, future-ready solutions and expert services can help meet those demands.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Inside the catalog:&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Technology strategies for building a future-ready workplace&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ways to activate the spaces between meetings with experience technology&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>How AI will reshape collaboration, communication, and engagement&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Case studies from Carrollton Bank and National Bank of Canada&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Greener tech choices that drive sustainable progress&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>How to protect enterprise control systems and stay ahead&nbsp;</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Tech partner solutions that scale with your business</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-view-the-digital-magazine\">View the digital magazine</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Click the center of the concept catalog image to view in full-screen mode within your browser.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://pages.avispl.com/hubfs/2025/2025%20pdf%20assets/2025%20Concept%20Catalog/AVI-SPL%202025%20Winter%20Concept%20Catalog.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Download the Concept Catalog</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"custom-html-block\">\n<div src=\"https://player.flipsnack.com/?hash=OThBQzdGNUJEQzkrN3VucWs5anpobQ==\" width=\"100%\" height=\"480\" seamless=\"seamless\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"autoplay; clipboard-read; clipboard-write\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\">\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    <!--\n      manifest.json provides metadata used when your web app is installed on a\n      user's mobile device or desktop. See: https://developers.google.com/web/fundamentals/web-app-manifest/\n    -->\n    <title>Flipsnack player</title>\n    \n    <!--  Reset Style  -->\n    \n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"root\"><div class=\"Readerstyles__PreloaderOverlay-sc-16q625f-0 iBXrSi\"><div class=\"BrandedPreloaderstyles__PreloaderContainer-sc-1dlr4gn-0 cBtRQe\"><div class=\"BrandedPreloaderstyles__Preloader-sc-1dlr4gn-1 iEjRoS\"><div class=\"BrandedPreloaderstyles__PreloaderIconContainer-sc-1dlr4gn-3 ReVDK\"><div class=\"BrandedPreloaderstyles__PreloaderIcon-sc-1dlr4gn-4 coJyZv\"></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</main>\n\n\n<div class=\"footer-pusher\" style=\"height: 1301.27px;\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div height=\"1\" width=\"1\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: none; visibility: hidden;\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"visibility: hidden; position: absolute; width: 100%; top: -10000px; left: 0px; right: 0px; transition: visibility linear 0.3s, opacity 0.3s linear; opacity: 0;\"><div style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; position: fixed; top: 0px; left: 0px; z-index: 2000000000; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); opacity: 0.5;\"></div><div style=\"margin: 0px auto; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; position: fixed; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); z-index: 2000000000; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><div title=\"recaptcha challenge expires in two minutes\" name=\"c-oxr0v